@startuml Non-Functional Requirements

title Carpooling and Shared Rides Management - Non-Functional Requirements

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<Security>> LightPink
  BackgroundColor<<Performance>> LightBlue
  BackgroundColor<<Reliability>> LightGreen
  BackgroundColor<<Usability>> LightYellow
  BackgroundColor<<Scalability>> LightCyan
}

package "Non-Functional Requirements" {
  rectangle "Data Encryption" as NFR1 <<Security>> {
    * Encryption of all PII data in databases
    * Secure transmission of sensitive data
    * Compliance with data protection regulations
  }

  rectangle "Performance Requirements" as NFR2 <<Performance>> {
    * API response time < 500ms under normal load
    * Match processing time < 5 seconds
    * Support for 1000+ concurrent users
    * In-memory caching for frequent queries
  }

  rectangle "Reliability & Availability" as NFR3 <<Reliability>> {
    * System uptime of 99.9%
    * Graceful degradation under high load
    * Automatic failover mechanisms
    * Comprehensive error logging
  }

  rectangle "Usability & Accessibility" as NFR4 <<Usability>> {
    * Intuitive, responsive UI
    * Mobile-friendly design
    * Compliance with WCAG 2.1 guidelines
    * Multi-language support
  }

  rectangle "Scalability" as NFR5 <<Scalability>> {
    * Horizontal scaling of services
    * Database sharding capability
    * Asynchronous message processing
    * Load balancing across instances
  }
}

note bottom of NFR1
  PII includes names, emails,
  phone numbers, payment info
end note

note bottom of NFR3
  Monitoring and health checks
  are implemented for all services
end note

@enduml 